{"version":1,"key":"card:438","content":{"id":438,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"列表的内置方法。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"append"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"append","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用于将一个对象附加到列表末尾，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"append","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" "},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"就地修改列表"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。即不会返回修改后的新列表，而是直接修改旧列表。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> lst = [1, 2, 3]\n>>> lst.append(4)\n>>> lst\n[1, 2, 3, 4]","language":"py","uuid":"3bb64153-530c-4a5c-b5fc-5f3aed5c03b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"clear"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"clear","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" "},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"就地"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"清空列表"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> lst = [1, 2, 3]\n>>> lst.clear()\n>>> lst\n[]","language":"py","uuid":"91894e30-927b-4184-98ba-8e4fed6b37ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"copy"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"copy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 复制列表，"},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"复制后的两个列表不是同一对象"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> a = [1, 2, 3]\n>>> b = a.copy()\n>>> b[1] = 4\n>>> a\n[1, 2, 3]","language":"py","uuid":"11ebbbce-8eef-43c0-b216-a80074789190","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"count"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"计算指定的元素在列表中出现了多少次"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> ['to', 'be', 'or', 'not', 'to', 'be'].count('to')\n2\n\n>>> x = [[1, 2], 1, 1, [2, 1, [1, 2]]]\n>>> x.count(1)\n2\n>>> x.count([1, 2])\n1","language":"py","uuid":"6d48627b-f8c8-4b36-9dd9-27db39393b23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"extend"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"extend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能够同时将多个值附加到列表末尾，换而言之，你可使用一个列表来扩展另一个列表。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> a = [1, 2, 3]\n>>> b = [4, 5, 6]\n>>> a.extend(b)\n>>> a\n[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]","language":"py","uuid":"c1546e3d-c601-49fe-ba22-7a6cef98cfaf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"与拼接的差异在于，拼接产生了一个新的列表，而 "},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"extend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是原地修改"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"index"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在列表中查找指定值第一次出现的索引"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> knights = ['We', 'are', 'the', 'knights', 'who', 'say', 'ni']\n>>> knights.index('who')\n4\n>>> knights.index('herring')\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nValueError: 'herring' is not in list","language":"py","uuid":"0010821f-79d4-4d95-a761-86deb6114eaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"搜索不在列表中的值会引发异常。"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"insert"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将一个对象插入列表，第一个参数指定要插入的位置，第二个参数表示值"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> numbers = [1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7]\n>>> numbers.insert(3, 'four')\n>>> numbers\n[1, 2, 3, 'four', 5, 6, 7]","language":"py","uuid":"1240f838-03f9-4e73-9d27-85c5d1834739","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过空切片赋值也能实现，但是可读性没有这个好。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pop"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pop()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法用于删除并返回列表中指定索引位置的元素。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pop()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法可以接受一个可选参数，即要删除的元素的索引（默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即最后一个元素）。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = [1, 2, 3]\n>>> x.pop()\n3\n>>> x\n[1, 2]\n>>> x.pop(0)\n1\n>>> x\n[2]","language":"py","uuid":"559c35a8-948d-408b-b53e-ed8c13c60eb0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pop","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是唯一既修改列表又返回一个非 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 值的列表方法。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"remove"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"remove","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用于删除第一个为指定值的元素。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"remove","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是就地修改。"},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除不存在的值会抛出异常。"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = ['to', 'be', 'or', 'not', 'to', 'be']\n>>> x.remove('be')\n>>> x\n['to', 'or', 'not', 'to', 'be']\n\n>>> x.remove('bee')\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nValueError: list.remove(x): x not in list","language":"py","uuid":"f23f1311-6ed5-4c0f-9898-cf8c2bb21021","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"reverse"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"reverse","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 按相反的顺序排列列表中的元素，同样，原地修改"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = [1, 2, 3]\n>>> x.reverse()\n>>> x\n[3, 2, 1]","language":"py","uuid":"040b7945-e750-4c36-aceb-f9e0b75352dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sort"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sort","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用于对列表就地排序"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = [4, 6, 2, 1, 7, 9]\n>>> x.sort()\n>>> x\n[1, 2, 4, 6, 7, 9]","language":"py","uuid":"e0f22b65-1834-4833-9b7f-b71813729be5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不想就地排序，两个办法："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"copy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个副本"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sorted","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"a = [3, 2, 1]\nb = sorted(a)","language":"py","uuid":"b0b4dd4b-eb52-42fa-ac89-8861629a09bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sort","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接受两个可选参数："},{"type":"formatted","text":"key","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"reverse","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。这两个参数通常是按名称指定的，称为关键字参数"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = ['aardvark', 'abalone', 'acme', 'add', 'aerate']\n>>> x.sort(key=len)\n>>> x\n['add', 'acme', 'aerate', 'abalone', 'aardvark']","language":"py","uuid":"641144de-1497-40ca-9878-ea1bb310f413","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = [4, 6, 2, 1, 7, 9]\n>>> x.sort(reverse=True)\n>>> x\n[9, 7, 6, 4, 2, 1]","language":"py","uuid":"bea7288d-d04b-48c4-94fc-ecdd1f22a8af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sorted","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也接受参数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"key","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"reverse","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"tags":["Python/序列/列表"],"createTime":1719026079510,"updateTime":1744034606272,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744034606272}}